Files here are a trimmed and modified copy taken from the KVQuant subtree in
https://github.com/DHdroid/NSNQuant. The retained code covers Fisher-statistic
collection and coupled-VQ codebook fitting. Project-specific changes include:

  * removal of components that are not used by the CQ or TaSQ pipelines;
  * standalone entry points and paths for the repository's calibration workflow;
  * calibration-corpus and Fisher-statistic handling used by the experiments; and
  * TaSQ channel transforms, grouping metadata, and weighted codebook fitting.

The files retain their original Apache License 2.0 terms. TaSQ-specific changes
are distributed under the repository's Apache License 2.0.
